375
00:25:11.510 --> 00:25:12.511
Doon.

376
00:25:12.595 --> 00:25:13.429
salamat po.

377
00:25:17.183 --> 00:25:18.184
Hey.

378
00:25:19.727 --> 00:25:22.063
Ano ba naman? Nandito ka ba para mag-audition?

379
00:25:22.146 --> 00:25:23.231
ikaw din?

380
00:25:23.314 --> 00:25:24.565
Akala ko bagsak mo noon.

381
00:25:25.274 --> 00:25:26.525
Sinusubukan mo ba ulit?

382
00:25:26.609 --> 00:25:28.402
Oo, sinabi nila sa akin
na pumasok para sa isa pang pagsubok.

383
00:25:29.153 --> 00:25:31.614
Pero ikaw ang tunay niyang nakababatang kapatid.
Ano ang gagawin mo?

384
00:25:32.448 --> 00:25:34.158
Sino ang nakakaalam? Hindi rin ako sigurado kung aabot ako.

385
00:25:34.242 --> 00:25:35.243
ano?

386
00:25:35.826 --> 00:25:36.661
Ito ay isang problema.

387
00:25:38.996 --> 00:25:40.206
-Hello.
-Hello.

388
00:25:40.289 --> 00:25:41.874
-Natutuwa akong makilala ka.
-Hello.

389
00:25:43.709 --> 00:25:45.836
Kamukha mo talaga si Mr. Lim.

390
00:25:48.798 --> 00:25:49.632
Oo.

391
00:25:51.509 --> 00:25:53.302
Jeez.

392
00:25:53.386 --> 00:25:56.055
Ako dapat ang nagmamaneho nitong sasakyan
sa halip na linisin ito.

393
00:25:56.138 --> 00:25:58.140
Ito ay napaka pathetic.

394
00:26:03.479 --> 00:26:05.523
Mr. Lim, alam mo na

395
00:26:05.606 --> 00:26:07.608
na hindi ito mabuti para sa inyong tatlo.

396
00:26:08.734 --> 00:26:11.112
Kung ayaw mong sumama sa mga lupon,

397
00:26:11.195 --> 00:26:14.699
siguro oras na para pumili ng landas
at manatili dito.

398
00:26:14.782 --> 00:26:16.617
Mukhang nagawa mo na
nakapagdesisyon na rin.

399
00:26:19.578 --> 00:26:20.871
Jeez.

400
00:26:21.789 --> 00:26:22.623
Darn it.

401
00:26:29.130 --> 00:26:31.132
Narito ang audition video
para sa nakababatang sarili ni Kang Pil-gu.

402
00:26:31.215 --> 00:26:33.467
Gusto ko silang dalawa,
ngunit mangyaring tingnan para sa iyong sarili.

403
00:26:35.052 --> 00:26:36.095
KANDIDATO 24, LIM SEON-U

404
00:26:36.679 --> 00:26:39.056
Tita, dapat ba akong maging isang pulis?

405
00:26:39.598 --> 00:26:40.766
Ang munting punk na ito!

406
00:26:43.853 --> 00:26:45.062
HAMCHORONG

407
00:26:47.773 --> 00:26:49.150
-Hoy, ako ito.
-Oo, Ginoong Lim?

408
00:26:49.233 --> 00:26:51.986
Makinig, hindi para sa papel na ito si Lim Seon-u!

409
00:26:52.069 --> 00:26:54.822
-Walang paraan!
-Nakilala ko silang dalawa--

410
00:26:54.905 --> 00:26:56.407
-Mas gugustuhin ko pang sumama kay Hong-sin.
-Ano?

411
00:26:56.490 --> 00:26:58.200
Wi Hong-sin. Mas maganda siya.

412
00:26:58.993 --> 00:27:00.536
Lim Seon-u talagang hindi gagawin!

413
00:27:03.122 --> 00:27:04.248
Yung munting punk.

414
00:27:04.332 --> 00:27:05.708
SEON-U

415
00:27:09.837 --> 00:27:11.672
ANG BIG BRO KO

416
00:27:20.473 --> 00:27:22.725
-Ang taong sinusubukan mong abutin...
-Bakit hindi siya sumasagot?

417
00:27:25.936 --> 00:27:26.937
Jeez.

418
00:27:40.701 --> 00:27:41.535
hey,

419
00:27:42.203 --> 00:27:43.871
